  <XDFCONSTANT uniqueid="0x57F6">
    <title>Purge Activated BLMPT Reset Factor (KCPBLDLA)</title>
    <description>BLMPT IS RESET TO (SAMOFFID-KCPBLDLA) IF PURGEDC IS CURRENTLY &lt; KCPBLDCL AND NTPSLD &lt; KCPBLTPS AND PURGEDC HAS PREVIOUSLY BEEN &gt; KCPBLDCH, ALL WHILE IN CELL 1 (ASSURES NOT TOO LEAN ON PURGE ACTIVE- NOT ACTIVE TRANSITION).</description>
